      "sourceId": "en:body",
      "quote": "Toggle: Anivia calls forth a driving rain of ice and hail that Slows enemies by 20/30/40% and deals (30/45/60 + (12.5% Ability Power)) magic damage per second. The storm increases in size over 1.5 seconds. When the storm is fully formed, it Chills, Slows by 30/45/60%, and does (90/135/180 + (37.5% Ability Power)) magic damage per second instead. The storm ends if Anivia is too far away."
    }
